WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:31.960
I did not!

01:34.120 --> 01:37.000
I just do not want you
to fall deeper for Ji Yingying.

01:39.360 --> 01:40.400
I envy her.

01:40.480 --> 01:42.000
But above all else, I am scared.

01:43.560 --> 01:46.080
I am scared that you will end up
destroying yourself because of her!

01:46.880 --> 01:48.120
- Chi Hu!
- Yes!

01:48.200 --> 01:51.040
Take everyone to the weavers' camp
and send all the craftsmen back to Yizhou!

01:51.120 --> 01:52.280
- But…!
- Your Highness!

01:52.360 --> 01:53.320
Go now!

01:54.680 --> 01:55.840
Yes.

01:55.920 --> 01:57.680
Your Highness, take care of yourself.

01:57.760 --> 01:59.840
Everyone, come with me!

02:03.920 --> 02:04.920
Get down.

02:12.560 --> 02:13.720
Your Highness, you should not go!

02:15.880 --> 02:16.800
Your Highness!

02:28.520 --> 02:30.680
Made in ten months.

02:33.840 --> 02:36.080
What a rare talent.

02:38.920 --> 02:40.200
It is such a shame.

02:41.560 --> 02:42.440
Were they sacrificial soldiers you sent?

02:43.040 --> 02:44.680
Yes. They will never rest
until the mission is complete.

02:47.680 --> 02:48.680
However…

02:50.440 --> 02:51.480
Speak.

02:51.560 --> 02:54.200
Although they will not
leave behind any evidence,

02:55.320 --> 02:57.920
Prince Bai is still likely to suspect you.

02:59.560 --> 03:01.040
After this,

03:01.120 --> 03:03.760
you and Prince Bai
will truly be at odds to the bitter end.

03:04.960 --> 03:06.760
Even if this never happens,

03:07.600 --> 03:09.880
do you think there is a chance

03:09.960 --> 03:11.920
for me and Prince Bai to reconcile?

03:12.440 --> 03:15.840
But Prince Bai cares
about Ji Yingying so much.

03:16.520 --> 03:19.200
He would come after you relentlessly soon.

03:20.880 --> 03:22.840
Do you know why I want Ji Yingying dead?

03:25.480 --> 03:27.920
I am mad at her
for humiliating me numerous times.

03:28.600 --> 03:29.960
But killing her

03:32.840 --> 03:34.840
is for Prince Bai's sake.

03:42.000 --> 03:43.000
We have yet to find the target.

03:43.080 --> 03:44.760
- Continue the search!
- Understood!

05:01.640 --> 05:02.720
Sheng Fengze?

05:04.640 --> 05:05.680
Sheng Fengze.

05:36.880 --> 05:38.640
Sheng Fengze!

06:01.320 --> 06:02.480
Sheng Fengze.

06:16.600 --> 06:17.440
Sheng Fengze…

06:17.520 --> 06:19.000
Sheng Fengze?

06:20.120 --> 06:21.480
I am sorry

06:22.600 --> 06:24.280
that you had to see the blood.

06:28.320 --> 06:29.800
I guess

06:31.280 --> 06:33.600
you will not be forgetting me
anytime soon, will you?

06:38.640 --> 06:39.680
Ji Yingying,

06:42.000 --> 06:43.080
did you catch a glimpse

06:44.080 --> 06:48.360
of the other half of my heart
I have laid bare for you?

06:50.640 --> 06:51.960
Sheng Fengze…

06:53.760 --> 06:54.600
Sheng?

06:55.360 --> 06:56.320
Sheng!

06:56.400 --> 06:57.560
Sheng.

06:57.640 --> 07:00.080
Sheng, I was wrong. Sheng!

07:00.160 --> 07:01.760
Sheng, I am so sorry!

07:01.840 --> 07:04.280
Sheng! Sheng! Sheng.

07:04.360 --> 07:06.720
Ning, this is…

07:08.080 --> 07:10.480
the last time
I would ask a favor from you.

07:12.960 --> 07:16.960
Please ensure Ji Yingying
makes it home safely.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.080
All right.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.120
I promise you.

07:23.440 --> 07:24.440
Sheng…

07:25.800 --> 07:26.920
Sheng Fengze.

07:44.840 --> 07:46.320
Time to go home!

07:49.440 --> 07:51.360
Let us head home!

07:51.440 --> 07:52.960
We are finally heading home now!

07:54.240 --> 07:55.880
What do you think? When we get back,

07:55.960 --> 07:59.000
should we take a stroll by Huanhua Creek
or grab a drink at Yuebuhuan Inn?

07:59.080 --> 08:00.360
A drink, of course!

08:01.600 --> 08:02.520
When we get back,

08:02.600 --> 08:04.360
your father is probabl
y going to both scold

08:04.440 --> 08:05.720
and hug you while crying.

08:05.800 --> 08:08.040
And he might even hit you
with a shoe sole as he cries.

08:08.560 --> 08:11.200
I do not mind that
as long as I am with my family.

08:15.320 --> 08:17.720
- They are not letting us through?
- Do not worry.

08:17.800 --> 08:19.000
Mr. Yang is on his way.

08:19.080 --> 08:20.240
They will let us through eventually.

08:20.320 --> 08:21.560
Let them through!

08:28.240 --> 08:29.680
Follow me.
I will escort you back to Yizhou.

08:30.320 --> 08:32.120
- Why is Yingying not here?
- That is right. Where is Yingying?

08:34.799 --> 08:36.559
His Highness has already left with her.

08:36.640 --> 08:37.480
You will meet up with them on the way.

08:39.080 --> 08:41.640
Let us go home!

08:41.720 --> 08:42.559
Come on!

08:42.640 --> 08:43.600
- We are going home.
- To home!

08:43.679 --> 08:45.120
Let us go home!

11:05.160 --> 11:07.120
By next spring,

11:11.920 --> 11:14.400
this place will be blooming with flowers.

11:17.640 --> 11:22.800
BAI SHENG'S MEMORIAL TABLET

11:34.320 --> 11:39.440
BROCADE BUREAU

11:44.400 --> 11:45.360
Officer,

11:46.240 --> 11:47.560
the brocade for the tribute
to the military commissioner

11:47.640 --> 11:49.680
and the clothing needed
for the general's birthday are all here.

11:50.920 --> 11:54.440
Who is the one who made the clothing
the Commissioner is wearing tomorrow?

11:54.520 --> 11:55.480
That would be me.

11:55.560 --> 11:56.920
You can head in alone.

11:58.040 --> 11:59.280
Officer,

11:59.360 --> 12:01.720
I am his wife. I can handle the tailoring.

12:01.800 --> 12:03.960
If the Commissioner's clothing
needs adjustments,

12:04.040 --> 12:05.560
I can make them on the spot.

12:05.640 --> 12:06.920
Please let me come along.

12:07.600 --> 12:08.520
All right, then.

12:08.600 --> 12:10.160
You two can head in together.

12:10.920 --> 12:12.120
Yu.

12:14.080 --> 12:16.480
Having another by your side
is always better.

12:24.440 --> 12:25.920
If so, thank you, my wife.

12:31.040 --> 12:32.040
Mr. Ji,

12:33.600 --> 12:34.800
Ms. Yu,

12:37.560 --> 12:38.840
please be careful.

12:40.200 --> 12:41.920
If we are running late,

12:42.440 --> 12:45.000
please check on my mother, Mr. Yang.

12:47.280 --> 12:48.480
I will.

12:49.480 --> 12:50.520
Thank you.

13:46.240 --> 13:48.320
How impudent!
Why are you not greeting the Commissioner?

13:52.200 --> 13:53.560
You are a tailor?

13:54.480 --> 13:57.160
My robe does not fit quite right.

13:57.240 --> 13:58.320
Come over here and adjust it.

14:05.200 --> 14:07.080
Do not worry.

14:07.600 --> 14:08.840
I am not one for violence.

14:09.960 --> 14:12.880
But sometimes, the best way
to cover up a mistake

14:12.960 --> 14:15.000
is to silence the witness.

14:15.080 --> 14:16.120
Is it not?

14:17.000 --> 14:20.160
My father always said
that everyone makes mistakes.

14:20.240 --> 14:21.560
What matters

14:21.640 --> 14:22.840
is whether you can admit them
and change course.

14:24.680 --> 14:25.600
Nicely said!

14:26.400 --> 14:28.800
If I am willing to do it,
would you stop hating me?

14:28.880 --> 14:30.080
No.

14:30.600 --> 14:32.320
I harbor a deep hatred for you, General.

14:33.880 --> 14:36.320
My father died because of your schemes,

14:36.400 --> 14:39.920
and even now, my sister cannot come home,

14:40.000 --> 14:41.640
thanks to you.

14:42.520 --> 14:43.680
There you have it.

14:44.200 --> 14:46.640
There is no turning back now.

14:46.720 --> 14:47.840
Yes.

14:48.800 --> 14:49.760
It is too late now.

14:51.120 --> 14:52.400
You are right.

14:53.320 --> 14:54.880
It is late now.

14:54.960 --> 14:57.400
Why hasn't Yang Jinglan arrived yet?

15:02.560 --> 15:05.240
After Yang Jinglan saved him,

15:05.320 --> 15:07.440
I regret hanging him there.

15:07.520 --> 15:10.560
I do not know how Yang Jinglan got in
or who is helping him,

15:11.440 --> 15:14.080
but I know he will come for me.

15:14.840 --> 15:17.800
And this is the only chance you,
the brocade craftsman,

15:18.320 --> 15:19.840
will have to face me directly.

15:21.240 --> 15:24.200
So, you decided to play along.

15:48.000 --> 15:49.400
Do not worry, miss.

15:49.480 --> 15:51.200
I, Yang Jinglan, have returned.

16:14.520 --> 16:16.480
Since you have your own plans, General,

16:17.000 --> 16:18.560
we have also prepared a backup plan.

16:19.680 --> 16:21.520
To you,

16:21.600 --> 16:23.800
we are insignificant
in the brocade industry.

16:24.320 --> 16:25.960
But Yizhou is our home.

16:26.040 --> 16:27.800
If anyone tries to destroy it,

16:27.880 --> 16:29.920
we, the insignificant, will unite
and take on enemies much larger than us.

16:31.160 --> 16:32.000
Your mistake started

16:32.080 --> 16:33.480
when you decided
to trample on the brocade industry.

16:34.240 --> 16:35.360
Today,

16:35.440 --> 16:39.080
I will use the Shu brocade
to mark your downfall!

16:45.280 --> 16:46.840
The boxes are covered in oil!

16:58.640 --> 17:00.120
Yang Jinglan!

17:00.200 --> 17:02.120
Niu Jin is here!

17:05.000 --> 17:06.359
Ji Yaoting!

17:15.839 --> 17:17.680
Look at them, like a moth to the flame.

17:17.760 --> 17:19.200
What a tragic pair.

17:19.280 --> 17:20.640
Come.

17:20.720 --> 17:22.119
Let her go. Let her join him,

17:23.160 --> 17:24.280
so they can die together.

17:28.520 --> 17:29.480
I am all right.

17:36.720 --> 17:37.960
Kill them.

18:05.000 --> 18:07.200
Yaoting, I will handle the rest.

18:07.280 --> 18:08.120
All right.

18:11.080 --> 18:12.200
Niu Jin,

18:13.400 --> 18:15.040
you conspired with Nanzhao,
smuggled tribute brocades,

18:15.920 --> 18:17.840
and plotted against
the three brocade officers of Yizhou

18:17.920 --> 18:19.720
and the military commissioner, Mu Hui.

18:19.800 --> 18:20.920
You also massacred the people of Yizhou!

18:23.800 --> 18:26.040
According to the law,
you should be executed!

18:28.040 --> 18:29.800
I am the military commissioner of Yizhou.

18:29.880 --> 18:31.480
Even if I am guilty,

18:31.560 --> 18:33.280
the Emperor should be the one
to pass judgment,

18:34.400 --> 18:36.720
not someone like you!

18:41.560 --> 18:42.560
Kill him.

18:59.080 --> 19:00.080
Watch out!

19:09.640 --> 19:10.920
Ji Yaoting!

19:42.920 --> 19:44.520
I dare you to come closer!

19:54.280 --> 19:56.280
You are all my men.

19:56.360 --> 19:58.280
Your blades are stained
with Mu Hui's blood!

19:59.360 --> 20:00.480
Xue Yu might let others off,

20:00.560 --> 20:02.480
but he will never
have mercy on any of you.

20:02.560 --> 20:06.240
Since there is no escaping death,
why not drag someone else along?

20:06.320 --> 20:07.360
Think carefully

20:07.440 --> 20:09.920
about who got you into this mess!

20:10.000 --> 20:11.320
If you surrender now,

20:12.680 --> 20:15.800
I can make sure your family
will not be blamed for your crimes!

20:33.600 --> 20:35.000
I knew it.

20:35.080 --> 20:36.800
It is better to rely on yourself
rather than others.

20:37.440 --> 20:38.680
This is what they mean by,
"Righteousness attracts support,

20:39.320 --> 20:40.400
while wrongdoing invites isolation."

20:42.360 --> 20:45.280
More like, "Little thieves are hanged,
but great ones escape."

20:46.400 --> 20:49.000
You were so focused
on being a loyal subject.

20:49.080 --> 20:50.120
And what happened?

20:50.200 --> 20:52.440
Your wife left you,
your friend turned up dead,

20:52.520 --> 20:56.680
and now, the court makes you
a scapegoat and hunts you.

20:57.440 --> 20:59.040
What exactly have you won over me?

20:59.680 --> 21:01.120
I never want

21:01.840 --> 21:03.920
to win over anyone.

21:05.840 --> 21:07.360
I just want justice.

21:09.240 --> 21:12.000
In this world, there simply
is no such thing as justice.

22:34.760 --> 22:36.600
No, Linglong!

22:36.680 --> 22:37.720
Linglong!

22:52.120 --> 22:53.320
Niu Jin,

22:54.200 --> 22:56.240
I will make you pay with your life!

22:59.240 --> 23:00.920
I will give you a chance for that.

23:01.000 --> 23:02.040
Give it your best.

23:10.560 --> 23:11.600
This is my fault.

23:12.160 --> 23:13.840
If I knew how to wield a sword,

23:14.720 --> 23:15.720
I could have protected you.

23:18.160 --> 23:19.560
If you know that,

23:20.960 --> 23:22.200
who will weave the brocade, then?

23:27.760 --> 23:29.320
I was planning

23:31.360 --> 23:35.000
to find a day to…

23:38.160 --> 23:40.400
But that is not possible now.

23:44.440 --> 23:47.800
Every year when the flowers bloom,

23:49.400 --> 23:50.560
go to…

23:52.200 --> 23:53.640
Go to the hill

23:53.720 --> 23:57.520
where my tree is planted and take a look.

23:59.600 --> 24:00.560
No.

24:01.920 --> 24:04.880
Once you get better,
we will head there together.

24:09.680 --> 24:11.000
Do live your life.

25:54.160 --> 25:57.680
This is on behalf of the law.

25:59.640 --> 26:03.200
This is for Linglong.

26:05.360 --> 26:09.560
This is for my master, Shen Rufeng.

26:10.320 --> 26:11.680
And this

26:14.920 --> 26:17.000
is for my friend,

26:17.920 --> 26:19.680
Zhuge Hong!

26:28.760 --> 26:30.800
The times are not in my favor,

26:30.880 --> 26:34.120
and these young fools
are getting too conceited.

27:45.400 --> 27:47.600
Is Yizhou up ahead of us?

27:48.120 --> 27:49.400
Yingying,

27:49.480 --> 27:51.560
Mr. Yang is here to take us home.

28:27.560 --> 28:32.000
BROCADE BUREAU

28:51.720 --> 28:52.680
Master Shen,

28:55.080 --> 28:56.080
Zhuge,

28:58.680 --> 28:59.800
I will leave

29:01.400 --> 29:02.960
Brocade Bureau for now.

29:03.480 --> 29:05.360
Yizhou is peaceful now.

29:06.800 --> 29:09.240
No matter who becomes
the brocade officer from now on,

29:10.560 --> 29:11.880
as long as I am here,

29:13.320 --> 29:17.400
no one will lose their life
over the brocade industry again.

29:19.000 --> 29:22.360
Meeting you has left me with no regrets.

29:22.440 --> 29:25.760
Here is a toast to see you off.

29:29.000 --> 29:30.120
Farewell.

29:38.120 --> 29:39.240
Everyone,

29:40.920 --> 29:42.400
I hope you will ensure

29:46.120 --> 29:47.440
the prosperity of the brocade industry.

29:49.520 --> 29:50.720
I am counting on you.

29:51.520 --> 29:53.920
Rest assured, Mr. Yang!
We will not fail you!

30:15.520 --> 30:18.040
You can finally have a proper wedding.
Congratulations!

30:18.120 --> 30:19.320
THE YANG RESIDENCE

30:19.400 --> 30:20.480
Are you not staying for a drink?

30:20.560 --> 30:22.240
The rules of the open road

30:22.320 --> 30:25.160
state that we will help in times of need
but not celebrate successes.

30:25.680 --> 30:26.880
But this brocade

30:27.720 --> 30:29.960
is the priceless Shu brocade
that is worth its weight in gold!

30:32.240 --> 30:33.960
The flowers in Jiangnan are blooming.

30:34.040 --> 30:35.560
I will miss them if I do not leave now.

30:37.160 --> 30:38.160
All right.

30:38.920 --> 30:40.240
Then, do me a favor.

30:40.320 --> 30:42.800
Relay a message to our friends
helping in Nanzhao.

30:43.320 --> 30:45.040
Send them my gratitude.

30:45.120 --> 30:46.080
When I have time,

30:46.160 --> 30:47.240
I will head to Jiangnan
to treat them to drinks.

30:47.920 --> 30:49.480
Deal! Consider it done.

30:58.040 --> 30:59.360
What are you up to?

30:59.440 --> 31:00.560
I have been looking everywhere for you.

31:00.640 --> 31:02.960
You are the most carefree person
in the house right now!

31:03.040 --> 31:05.200
- That was my friend.
- Hurry inside!

31:05.280 --> 31:06.240
Mother is waiting for you
to try on your wedding robes.

31:07.080 --> 31:08.120
- Come on, then!
- Let's go.

31:20.440 --> 31:22.480
How do you feel? Is it comfortable?

31:23.600 --> 31:26.080
If it does not fit, I will have
the tailor make adjustments.

31:26.840 --> 31:27.840
It fits perfectly.

31:29.920 --> 31:31.040
Thank you, Mother.

31:33.600 --> 31:36.000
Let me see the groom!

31:36.520 --> 31:38.200
- Father!
- My dear!

31:38.280 --> 31:39.200
Let me see…!

31:41.400 --> 31:42.240
Let me see.

31:42.320 --> 31:43.520
How do I look?

31:47.120 --> 31:49.480
Great! You look good!

31:50.440 --> 31:52.760
You have a bit of the charm
I had in my youth!

31:55.040 --> 31:56.400
Not quite on your level, Father.

31:58.120 --> 31:59.000
Jinglan,

32:01.040 --> 32:02.720
it has not been easy for you
and Yingying to get to this point.

32:03.600 --> 32:04.960
Cherish her.

32:06.800 --> 32:09.040
You see,

32:09.560 --> 32:11.240
giving up your position
as the brocade officer

32:11.320 --> 32:12.760
so suddenly was a bold choice.

32:15.080 --> 32:18.560
Your brothers and I have discussed it.

32:18.640 --> 32:21.200
They are willing
to give you a share of their shops.

32:23.840 --> 32:26.560
And I will teach you how to run
the business myself.

32:28.800 --> 32:30.000
Are you going to teach him?

32:30.080 --> 32:31.680
Why? Do you think I cannot do it?

32:32.360 --> 32:34.640
I have accomplished a lot in my day!

32:36.440 --> 32:37.680
- Father,
- This…

32:37.760 --> 32:39.440
it is not that.

32:39.960 --> 32:41.800
But if you are the one
teaching me business,

32:41.880 --> 32:43.160
I might as well not do it at all.

32:44.480 --> 32:45.880
What kind of talk is that?

32:46.600 --> 32:48.560
If you do not work,
how will you support yourself?

32:49.520 --> 32:51.440
My wife is one
of the most renowned figures

32:51.520 --> 32:53.440
in Yizhou's business world.

32:53.520 --> 32:55.480
All I need to do is be
the perfect husband to support her.

32:58.680 --> 32:59.840
Did you hear that?

32:59.920 --> 33:02.440
He could even say that!

33:02.520 --> 33:03.960
This…!

33:04.800 --> 33:06.600
You are young but idle

33:06.680 --> 33:08.320
and want to live off Yingying's success!

33:08.400 --> 33:11.280
Father, like father, like son!

33:11.880 --> 33:13.840
Besides, has Mother not taken care of you

33:13.920 --> 33:15.680
so well all these years?

33:16.560 --> 33:17.800
You are something!

33:18.920 --> 33:20.080
You…!

33:20.160 --> 33:21.840
- You ungrateful son!
- Stop!

33:21.920 --> 33:23.840
You did not notice me working,

33:23.920 --> 33:24.760
but you are quick
to catch me enjoying life.

33:24.840 --> 33:25.680
Father, just wait until after his wedding.

33:25.760 --> 33:26.840
Mother, tell us who is right here.

33:26.920 --> 33:28.840
- Let's…
- You are still too green

33:28.920 --> 33:30.240
to compare yourself to me!

33:30.840 --> 33:32.120
That is enough. Stop bickering.

33:32.200 --> 33:33.760
You are both grown men.

33:33.840 --> 33:36.040
Do not ruin Jinglan's wedding robes!

33:37.560 --> 33:39.720
Once the wedding is over,
I will teach you a lesson!

33:39.800 --> 33:41.000
Yes, do it!

33:48.920 --> 33:51.760
ACCOUNT BOOK

33:53.960 --> 33:55.360
Pin,

33:55.440 --> 33:57.320
can we deliver the Pearl and Peony Brocade

33:57.400 --> 33:59.440
and the Round Flower
and Bird Brocade for the Zhang family

33:59.520 --> 34:01.240
by the end of the month?

34:01.320 --> 34:02.760
Yes. I have got it.

34:05.360 --> 34:07.320
The Zhao family needs to settle
their balance by the end of the month.

34:07.400 --> 34:08.920
Do not worry. I will handle it.

34:09.960 --> 34:10.800
One more thing.

34:10.880 --> 34:13.480
The shipment of brocade for Tubo
and the Rippling Grain Brocade for Nanzhao

34:13.560 --> 34:16.679
due on the 15th day are important orders.

34:16.760 --> 34:18.320
There cannot be any mistakes.

34:18.400 --> 34:19.800
All right.

34:19.880 --> 34:22.760
Just think about trying on
your wedding robes today.

34:22.840 --> 34:25.600
Are you worried
to leave the business to us?

34:26.239 --> 34:27.320
I am not.

34:30.000 --> 34:31.840
- Ms. Ji.
- Gui.

34:31.920 --> 34:33.960
You have been so occupied
that you have hardly eaten.

34:34.040 --> 34:35.920
That is not good for you.

34:36.440 --> 34:37.480
Look at what I brought.

34:38.679 --> 34:39.800
Glutinous rice cakes!

34:40.320 --> 34:42.480
- Thank you, Gui.
- Have a little, at least.

34:42.560 --> 34:43.480
All right.

34:45.239 --> 34:47.360
How did you know I was hungry?
Where is my mother?

34:47.440 --> 34:50.360
Mrs. Ji is busy preparing
your wedding trousseau at home.

34:53.080 --> 34:54.120
You look nice.

34:56.920 --> 34:57.920
Have some, Pin.

35:00.360 --> 35:01.400
You must be starving.

35:02.360 --> 35:04.000
- It is delicious.
- Very delicious.

35:04.080 --> 35:05.120
Yingying!

35:05.200 --> 35:06.040
Yaoting?

35:07.800 --> 35:09.120
Look at this.

35:11.560 --> 35:12.720
Do you like it?

35:22.720 --> 35:25.200
This is something
Yuniang prepared for you a while ago.

35:26.240 --> 35:28.000
She said you like lively things,

35:28.080 --> 35:29.480
something that makes you happy
just by looking at it.

35:31.520 --> 35:32.600
I love it.

35:48.040 --> 35:49.720
What are you doing?

35:51.200 --> 35:53.160
Are they not beautiful?

35:53.680 --> 35:55.440
I am letting them enjoy some sunshine.

35:57.160 --> 35:59.960
They are not flowers or plants.
Why would they need sunshine?

36:00.040 --> 36:01.280
They will be damaged.

36:06.960 --> 36:07.960
No.

36:08.480 --> 36:11.000
They told me they are happy.

36:17.440 --> 36:19.560
But they told me they are upset.

36:19.640 --> 36:21.280
They want to go back
to lying in their box.

36:23.400 --> 36:25.400
Can you say something nice?
Otherwise, keep your mouth shut!

36:28.480 --> 36:30.520
It is unbearable hearing him
say those lines.

36:30.600 --> 36:31.960
I know. It is so strange.

36:32.680 --> 36:33.960
I feel the same way.

36:36.520 --> 36:37.720
The two definitely
have something going on.

36:37.800 --> 36:39.360
How can you tell?

36:39.880 --> 36:40.800
How could I not?

36:40.880 --> 36:43.280
I am only a month away
from becoming an old man myself.

36:44.240 --> 36:46.400
Back in the day,
my wife and I were just like them…

36:47.920 --> 36:49.920
Why am I telling you this?

36:50.000 --> 36:51.080
Hurry up! Off to lessons!

36:51.160 --> 36:52.120
Go to your lessons! Hurry!

36:52.200 --> 36:53.720
Go! Off to lessons with you! Go!

36:53.800 --> 36:56.440
Honestly,
you are following him around all day.

36:56.520 --> 36:57.360
He has been such a bad influence on you!

36:58.400 --> 37:00.600
Wait a moment!
What does this have to do with me?

37:00.680 --> 37:02.240
Pin, he is blaming me again!
Are you not going to deal with him?

37:02.320 --> 37:04.000
Pin might control you, but not me!

37:04.080 --> 37:05.120
I…!

37:06.200 --> 37:07.520
What does becoming an old man mean?

37:07.600 --> 37:10.040
It means becoming a father.

37:10.120 --> 37:11.480
Are you going to be a father?

37:12.280 --> 37:13.240
What is he doing here?

37:13.840 --> 37:15.320
Why is he already in his wedding robes?

37:15.400 --> 37:16.600
Did they change the date?

37:16.680 --> 37:18.440
- Let us go see!
- He…!

37:18.520 --> 37:19.840
- Yingying!
- Why is he…

37:45.400 --> 37:46.720
Why are you here?

37:46.800 --> 37:48.720
You are not supposed to see
each other before the wedding!

37:48.800 --> 37:50.320
This is not your first time.
Why are you in a rush?

37:51.360 --> 37:52.560
I know, Yaoting.

37:55.240 --> 37:57.480
Something major is happening.
My senior is here.

37:58.080 --> 38:00.880
- The crown prince?
- Isn't your senior the crown prince?

38:00.960 --> 38:02.200
Is the crown prince here?

38:03.400 --> 38:04.480
Greetings, Your Highness!

38:05.360 --> 38:06.400
Please rise. Spare the formalities.

38:08.360 --> 38:10.000
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

38:14.000 --> 38:14.960
But this requires kneeling.

38:16.800 --> 38:19.360
Hereby decreed, Ji Yingying of Sandaoyan,

38:19.880 --> 38:22.080
for her contribution
to the brocade industry,

38:22.160 --> 38:24.160
which has educated
and united foreign lands,

38:24.240 --> 38:26.000
and for opening trade routes

38:26.080 --> 38:27.440
that foster peace and goodwill
among neighboring regions,

38:27.520 --> 38:29.920
is to be honored
with the title of Lady of Silk.

38:30.000 --> 38:33.200
You are to oversee Yizhou's
brocade industry with the brocade officer

38:33.280 --> 38:34.720
and open all the trade routes.

38:35.760 --> 38:38.600
You are to depart tomorrow
for the capital to meet the Emperor.

38:38.680 --> 38:40.120
The decree ends.

38:41.160 --> 38:42.840
I accept the decree.

38:42.920 --> 38:45.280
Thank you, Your Majesty.
Thank you, Your Highness.

39:02.360 --> 39:03.480
Tomorrow?

39:04.000 --> 39:05.640
But their wedding is tomorrow!

39:05.720 --> 39:06.960
- That is right!
- That is right!

39:08.000 --> 39:08.880
Let us pick another day.

39:10.560 --> 39:12.560
A lifetime together as husband and wife
is such a blessing.

39:13.240 --> 39:14.800
I wish to help you soar.

39:14.880 --> 39:16.600
I wish to help you achieve all you desire.

39:18.240 --> 39:20.560
You do not need to wait.

39:21.160 --> 39:23.720
Jinglan, since I am here today,

39:23.800 --> 39:25.480
let us have the wedding now.

39:26.280 --> 39:27.760
I will serve as your witness.

39:29.040 --> 39:30.400
- Today?
- Today?

39:30.480 --> 39:32.960
- But Mother is unaware!
- And nothing is prepared!

39:33.560 --> 39:35.120
I will go and set up the venue!

39:35.200 --> 39:37.160
- I will invite the guests!
- The guests!

39:37.240 --> 39:39.080
- I will take care of the feast!
- Hurry!

39:39.160 --> 39:40.720
I will leave now!

39:40.800 --> 39:41.640
I will go now!

40:01.480 --> 40:03.240
We have found a Shu Red robe.

40:03.320 --> 40:06.440
That is mine! Father left it to me!

40:06.520 --> 40:08.600
If she knew how to give up,

40:08.680 --> 40:10.480
she would not be Ji Yingying.

40:10.560 --> 40:11.440
Look!

40:11.520 --> 40:12.960
What is that?

40:13.040 --> 40:14.680
I was waiting for people to come.

40:14.760 --> 40:17.160
Otherwise, would that not make

40:17.240 --> 40:18.160
my silk's grand appearance
a complete waste?

40:21.120 --> 40:23.920
I am here to collect the debt, not silk.

40:24.000 --> 40:26.680
The Ji family's debts
are fully repaid today.

40:26.760 --> 40:29.800
Take your money and leave now.

40:34.360 --> 40:36.720
You have all been hurt because of me.

40:37.240 --> 40:39.920
I, Ji Yingying, owe you an apology.

40:43.760 --> 40:45.120
A cornered beast fighting for survival.

40:45.720 --> 40:46.920
Is it not an entertaining sight, my dear?

40:47.960 --> 40:49.160
Let me go!

40:49.240 --> 40:50.560
She threatened me.

40:51.520 --> 40:54.320
But giving you up is my own choice.

40:56.800 --> 40:58.440
BRIDE-WELCOMING

41:07.760 --> 41:09.080
BROCADE BUREAU

41:14.640 --> 41:15.720
Wait!

41:23.240 --> 41:24.600
Who dares to marry her?

41:32.880 --> 41:34.800
Starting at 20 guan.

41:34.880 --> 41:36.560
Let the bidding commence!

41:43.360 --> 41:44.920
Father, it is your name.

41:45.000 --> 41:46.280
JI GUINAN, SHU RED

41:46.360 --> 41:47.640
JI YINGYING, FLUSHED ROSE
ZHAO XIUYUAN, SHU RED

41:49.440 --> 41:51.320
This is not just the color of blood.

41:51.920 --> 41:52.960
It is also…

41:53.800 --> 41:56.280
the color of Shu Red Silk.

42:00.160 --> 42:01.640
Father, I am not afraid.

42:02.400 --> 42:03.360
Toast to you!

42:03.440 --> 42:05.280
- Cheers!
- Bottoms up!

42:06.000 --> 42:07.320
Father said not to throw it away.
It will come in handy someday.

42:07.400 --> 42:08.320
That is pomegranate vinegar!

42:11.400 --> 42:12.480
Father did not lie to me.

42:13.160 --> 42:14.480
Yaoting,

42:15.000 --> 42:17.320
I will make sure everyone knows

42:17.400 --> 42:19.800
that Shu Red Silk
was dyed by the Ji family!

42:28.520 --> 42:30.280
Ji Yingying from the Ji family

42:30.360 --> 42:32.640
presents The Return of Phoenix.

42:39.840 --> 42:42.240
JI YINGYING, FLUSHED ROSE

42:47.680 --> 42:50.000
It is because we truly created
Nanzhao Brocade.

42:50.080 --> 42:51.880
Congratulations, King of Nanzhao!

42:52.400 --> 42:54.000
We did not disappoint

42:54.080 --> 42:55.760
and can finally return home.

42:57.800 --> 43:02.800
TAIJI HALL
